    qa: [
      { q: 'What can be inferred about why some users trust the slower flight site more?', choices: ['Its prices are always lower than the faster site\'s', 'Its visible checking suggests a more thorough search', 'Its waiting time is shorter than most users expect', 'Its list of airlines is longer than other sites\' lists'], answer: 1, why: '第1・3段落で、結果は同じだが、多くの可能性を調べたように見えることが質の目印になると説明している。見える確認作業が念入りな検索を思わせる。' },
      { q: 'Which situation would the writer most likely regard as a misuse of the labor illusion?', choices: ['A kitchen that lets diners watch real cooking', 'A delivery service that reports each real step', 'A locksmith who opens a lock very quickly', 'An app that shows fake activity to seem busy'], answer: 3, why: '第5段落 display busy-looking animations that reflect no real work を悪用の例として挙げている。' },
    ],
