    qa: [
      { q: 'According to Bertrand, why does the question have no single answer?', choices: ['The triangle is drawn in the wrong place', 'The calculations are too hard to complete', 'The circle may change size during the test', '"At random" is not clearly defined'], answer: 3, why: '第6段落：「無作為に」が弦の選び方を教えないからである。三角形の位置がちがう、計算がむずかしい、円の大きさが変わるとは書かれていない。' },
      { q: 'Which method did Jaynes favor?', choices: ['The one joining two points on the circle', 'The one using a random radius', 'The one combining all of the three methods', 'The one using random points as middles'], answer: 1, why: '第7段落：ジェインズは二つ目の方法、つまり無作為に半径を選ぶ方法だけが条件を満たすとした。ほかの方法を支持したとは書かれていない。' },
    ],
